  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.47392/irjaeh.2024.0329$q$, $q$Eco Smart Solar Powered Irrigation System$q$, $q$The ECO SMART solar powered irrigation system represents a novel approach to sustainable agriculture, integrating renewable energy and advanced technology to optimize water use and enhance crop productivity. By utilizing smart sensors and IoT technology, the system monitors soil moisture levels and crop requirements in real-time. …$q$, array[$q$B A Sujathakumari$q$,$q$M Baluchandra$q$,$q$Pandi Naga Sumanth$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$International Research Journal on Advanced Engineering Hub$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.47392/irjaeh.2024.0329$q$, $q$10.47392/irjaeh.2024.0329$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.18280/jesa.550413$q$, $q$Smart Solar Powered Irrigation System$q$, $q$A smart irrigation system is developed that automates the irrigation process powered by solar energy. This proposed system can optimize the use of water based on different data, such as soil moisture level, weather prediction, and soil temperature. …$q$, array[$q$Alao Olujimi$q$,$q$Aaron Afan Izang$q$,$q$Oyinloye Adebayo$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$Journal Europeen des Systemes Automatises$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.18280/jesa.550413$q$, $q$10.18280/jesa.550413$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.37017/jeae-volume11-no1.2025-1$q$, $q$A Review of Solar-Powered Irrigation Systems (SPIS)$q$, $q$Solar-Powered Irrigation Systems have emerged as a sustainable solution to enhance agricultural productivity, particularly in regions facing unreliable or limited access to energy sources. By integrating photovoltaic technology with irrigation methods, SPIS provide an environmentally friendly and cost-effective alternative to conventional irrigation systems. This review synthesizes design principles, components, operational challenges and future developments. …$q$, array[$q$S.M Nyaanga$q$,$q$D Oeba$q$]::text[], 2025, $q$Journal of Engineering in Agriculture and the Environment$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.37017/jeae-volume11-no1.2025-1$q$, $q$10.37017/jeae-volume11-no1.2025-1$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.5897/ajar2022.16294$q$, $q$Design optimization of communal solar powered irrigation system$q$, $q$Communal solar-powered irrigation systems have the potential for sharing the upfront costs hence encouraging farmers to adopt irrigation. Conventional methods of sizing photovoltaic water pumping systems consider the hydraulic energy requirement by the pump and PV generator capacity separately from the available water source capacity. The study aimed to determine the optimal PVWP system configuration. …$q$, array[$q$Kyeyune Isaac$q$,$q$Joshua Wanyama$q$]::text[], 2023, $q$African Journal of Agricultural Research$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.5897/ajar2022.16294$q$, $q$10.5897/ajar2022.16294$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.21608/ajs.2019.43070$q$, $q$Solar Powered Irrigation System for Turf Area$q$, $q$Solar water pumping system may be a competitive application for remote areas where power costs a lot. The study aimed to manage pump for sprinkler irrigation system operated by solar power in small area of turf, using a direct-coupled photovoltaic pumping system to operate a sprinkler irrigation network at the experimental farm. …$q$, array[$q$Manar Abdel-Hakeem$q$,$q$Abdelgany el gindy$q$,$q$Yasser E. Arafa$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$Arab Universities Journal of Agricultural Sciences$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.21608/ajs.2019.43070$q$, $q$10.21608/ajs.2019.43070$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W2907711616$q$, $q$Automatic Solar Powered Irrigation System in Greenhouse$q$, $q$This paper presents a prototype of an automated irrigation system used in a greenhouse (80 m2) to produce its energy from photovoltaic solar panels. In the experiment, two solar panels (220W) have been mounted near the greenhouse and energy was used for the automated irrigation control. …$q$, array[$q$Murat Yildirim$q$,$q$Muzaffer Yucel$q$,$q$Yakup Kilicarslan$q$]::text[], 2018, $q$Canakkale Onsekiz Mart University AVESIS$q$, $q$https://openalex.org/W2907711616$q$, null, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W7215569940$q$, $q$Design and Development of Solar-Powered Irrigation System for Sugarcane Cultivation$q$, $q$The objectives of this research were to design and examine the performance of a solar-powered irrigation system on different daytime for sugarcane cultivation in Udon Thani. The study was divided into two parts: the design of the system and the study of its technical performance across different times. …$q$, array[$q$Warachit Phayom$q$,$q$Witayakool Bunsiri$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$Academic Journal Uttaradit Rajabhat University$q$, $q$https://openalex.org/W7215569940$q$, null, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W2997956922$q$, $q$Effect of Solar Powered Irrigation System on Crop Growth$q$, $q$The solar powered irrigation system is an adaptive plants and crops irrigation system. The purposes are to provide water delivering schedule to the crops, to reduce the amount of water waste in irrigation, and to minimize the economic cost for the users. The system takes in real time data of the water content of the plant as input value. …$q$, array[$q$S A Ojo$q$,$q$Linus Uchechukwu Anih$q$,$q$Emmanuel A. Anazia$q$]::text[], 2019, null, $q$https://openalex.org/W2997956922$q$, null, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.52783/iwi.v44i1.83$q$, $q$Solar-Powered Irrigation Systems for Small-Scale Farmers$q$, $q$Solar-powered watering systems are becoming a long-term option for small farmers, especially in places where water is scarce and power is not always available. This research looks at the pros and cons of using solar-powered watering systems in small farms, where farmers must use water while keeping costs as low as possible. …$q$, array[$q$Leena Bharat Chaudhari$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$Water and Irrigation Review$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.52783/iwi.v44i1.83$q$, $q$10.52783/iwi.v44i1.83$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.52151/jae2024616.1884$q$, $q$Solar-Powered Irrigation Systems: Sustainability, Advancements and Future Prospects$q$, $q$Extensive groundwater irrigation using diesel and electric pumps resulted in environmental issues like air pollution and carbon emissions. The country is turning to solar-powered irrigation systems, an eco-friendly alternative that offers potential to reduce fossil fuel reliance and greenhouse gas emissions. Solar drip irrigation, in particular, is discussed. …$q$, array[$q$R. T. Thokal$q$,$q$A. G. Mohod$q$,$q$K. G. Dhande$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$Journal of Agricultural Engineering (India)$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.52151/jae2024616.1884$q$, $q$10.52151/jae2024616.1884$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W3184630441$q$, $q$A Research Paper on Solar Powered Irrigation System$q$, $q$The main purpose of this paper is to provide an automatic irrigation device which senses the level of soil moisture itself, using a soil moisture sensor. If the soil moisture level falls below a certain amount, the sensor sends the detected value to the microcontroller and water is supplied to the crops automatically. …$q$, array[$q$Jitesh Kumar$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$Journal of Emerging Technologies and Innovative Research$q$, $q$https://openalex.org/W3184630441$q$, null, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.11594/ijmaber.03.10.15$q$, $q$Understanding the Economics of Solar Powered Irrigation System in Bangladesh$q$, $q$Solar pump is an environmental-friendly irrigation option for farmers in Bangladesh. The objectives of the present study were to understand the profitability analysis of using solar pumps instead of the diesel-run pumps for irrigation and also to identify its determinants. …$q$, array[$q$Taslima Akter$q$,$q$Kazi Ehsanul Bari$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$International Journal of Multidisciplinary Applied Business and Education Research$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.11594/ijmaber.03.10.15$q$, $q$10.11594/ijmaber.03.10.15$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.17159/2413-3051/2021/v32i2a9045$q$, $q$The extent, characteristics and potential of solar powered irrigation systems in South Africa$q$, $q$South Africa has been identified as having a high potential for solar powered irrigation. However, there has been a lag in the development of solar powered irrigation systems there, mainly due to the high investment cost. The work sought to determine the extent of solar powered irrigation and characteristics of the system types in use. …$q$, array[$q$P. Piliso$q$,$q$Aidan Senzanje$q$,$q$Khumbulani Dhavu$q$]::text[], 2021, $q$Journal of Energy in Southern Africa$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.17159/2413-3051/2021/v32i2a9045$q$, $q$10.17159/2413-3051/2021/v32i2a9045$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.18178/jocet.2019.7.6.514$q$, $q$A Solar-Powered Irrigation System for Conserving Water and Energy Consumption in Egypt$q$, $q$The aim of this paper is to present energy and cost analysis for a simulation of a solar-powered pumping system in Egypt using HOMER software. Experimental work is also carried out for a solar-powered irrigation system which conserves water and energy through the use of a soil moisture sensor to regulate watering. …$q$, array[$q$Mina Ashraf$q$,$q$M. M. Fouad$q$,$q$Lamia Ahmed Shihata$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$Journal of Clean Energy Technologies$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.18178/jocet.2019.7.6.514$q$, $q$10.18178/jocet.2019.7.6.514$q$, array[$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$soil moisture$q$,$q$water pump$q$,$q$renewable energy$q$,$q$agriculture$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1186/s13104-015-0971-9$q$, $q$Cyborg beast: a low-cost 3d-printed prosthetic hand for children with upper-limb differences$q$, $q$There is an increasing number of children with traumatic and congenital hand amputations or reductions. Families' financial resources play a crucial role in the prescription of prostheses for their children, especially when private insurance and public funding are insufficient. Due to the complexity and high cost of electric-powered and body-powered devices, a low-cost 3D-printed hand is evaluated. …$q$, array[$q$Jorge M. Zuniga$q$,$q$Dimitrios Katsavelis$q$,$q$Jean L. Peck$q$]::text[], 2015, $q$BMC Research Notes$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1186/s13104-015-0971-9$q$, $q$10.1186/s13104-015-0971-9$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.22214/ijraset.2022.40870$q$, $q$Low Cost Design of 3D Printed Prosthetic Hand with IR Sensor$q$, $q$Disabled persons with upper limb amputation cannot buy a commercial prosthetic hand because it is very expensive. This paper includes the design and development of a low-cost prosthetic hand with five fingers capable of movement, wearable by persons who have amputation in the hand. …$q$, array[$q$Desai Akash Chandrakant$q$,$q$Shaikh Sohil Jahangir$q$,$q$Sharma Abhishek Rajendra$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$International Journal for Research in Applied Science and Engineering Technology$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.22214/ijraset.2022.40870$q$, $q$10.22214/ijraset.2022.40870$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3390/app14198929$q$, $q$Development of a Low-Cost 3D-Printed Upper Limb Prosthetic Device with Hybrid Actuation for Partial Hand Amputees$q$, $q$Assistive technology plays an important role in rehabilitation. Our aim was to establish an alternative design for a partial hand prosthetic with both body and external power. A mixed actuation system was conceived to generate the grasping force required to impel the transitional partial hand. …$q$, array[$q$Florinfelix Raduica$q$,$q$Ionel Simion$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$Applied Sciences$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3390/app14198929$q$, $q$10.3390/app14198929$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1371/journal.pone.0214120$q$, $q$Low-cost sensor-integrated 3D-printed personalized prosthetic hands for children with amniotic band syndrome$q$, $q$A three-dimensional scanning and 3D printing process enabled the design and fabrication of a sensor-integrated anatomical human-machine interface in the form of personalized prosthetic hands that contain anatomically conformal electrode arrays for sensing pressure distribution. …$q$, array[$q$Yuxin Tong$q$,$q$Ezgi Kucukdeger$q$,$q$Justin Halper$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$PLoS ONE$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0214120$q$, $q$10.1371/journal.pone.0214120$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3389/frobt.2020.594196$q$, $q$Suitability of the Openly Accessible 3D Printed Prosthetic Hands for War-Wounded Children$q$, $q$The field of rehabilitation and assistive devices is being disrupted by innovations in desktop 3D printers and open-source designs. We evaluated the most popular designs of body-powered, 3D printed prosthetic hands and selected a representative sample to evaluate its suitability, functionality, durability, and price for those in difficult living conditions. …$q$, array[$q$John-John Cabibihan$q$,$q$Farah Alkhatib$q$,$q$Mohammed Mudassir$q$]::text[], 2021, $q$Frontiers in Robotics and AI$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3389/frobt.2020.594196$q$, $q$10.3389/frobt.2020.594196$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1371/journal.pone.0232766$q$, $q$A practical 3D-printed soft robotic prosthetic hand with multi-articulating capabilities$q$, $q$Soft robotic hands with monolithic structure have shown great potential to be used as prostheses due to their light weight and compact designs as well as ease of manufacture. This work addressed practical requirements with the consideration of the trade-off between practicality and performance. …$q$, array[$q$Alireza Mohammadi$q$,$q$Jim Lavranos$q$,$q$Hao Zhou$q$]::text[], 2020, $q$PLoS ONE$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0232766$q$, $q$10.1371/journal.pone.0232766$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1145/3351260$q$, $q$Using Deep Learning and Mobile Offloading to Control a 3D-printed Prosthetic Hand$q$, $q$We develop a low cost, adaptable and personalizable system of an artificial prosthetic hand with consumer grade electromyography recording hardware, a mobile companion device with deep learning classification, a cloud component for offloading computations, and a mechanical 3D printed arm operated by embedded hardware. …$q$, array[$q$Kirill Shatilov$q$,$q$Dimitris Chatzopoulos$q$,$q$Alex Wong Tat Hang$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$Proceedings of the ACM on Interactive, Mobile, Wearable and Ubiquitous Technologies$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1145/3351260$q$, $q$10.1145/3351260$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.5535/arm.2017.41.5.875$q$, $q$Hand Functions of Myoelectric and 3D-Printed Pressure-Sensored Prosthetics: A Comparative Study$q$, $q$Customized upper-extremity myoelectric prostheses remain heavy and expensive. Three-dimensional printing is a promising avenue for reducing the cost of prosthesis. We applied 3D-printed pressure-sensored prosthetics to a traumatic transradial amputee and compared the results with a myoelectric prosthesis. …$q$, array[$q$Kyu-ho Lee$q$,$q$Hobeom Bin$q$,$q$KeunBae Kim$q$]::text[], 2017, $q$Annals of Rehabilitation Medicine$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.5535/arm.2017.41.5.875$q$, $q$10.5535/arm.2017.41.5.875$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W2781874150$q$, $q$3D Printed Prosthetic Hand$q$, $q$3D printed prosthetic hands are a common medical device for pediatric partial hand patients due to their manufacturability and cost-effectiveness. We aim to modify an existing 3D printed prosthetic hand to enable the user to switch between a single fist grip and three-finger chuck as well as lock the grip being used. …$q$, array[$q$Mark Sullivan$q$,$q$Bryan C. Oh$q$,$q$Ian Taylor$q$]::text[], 2017, $q$Open Scholarship Institutional Repository (Washington University in St. Louis)$q$, $q$https://openalex.org/W2781874150$q$, null, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1080/23335432.2017.1364666$q$, $q$System for the experimental evaluation of anthropomorphic hands. Application to a new 3D-printed prosthetic hand prototype$q$, $q$We propose a new actuation device and protocol for testing the grasping performance of low-cost 3D-printed hand prototypes. The protocol includes grasping actions on 24 different objects using eight typical grasp types to obtain a grasping ability score and information about the coordination of motion among the fingers. …$q$, array[$q$Immaculada Llop-Harillo$q$,$q$Antonio Perez-Gonzalez$q$]::text[], 2017, $q$International Biomechanics$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1080/23335432.2017.1364666$q$, $q$10.1080/23335432.2017.1364666$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.55041/ijsrem55602$q$, $q$Design and Implementation of an EMG-Based 3D-Printed Prosthetic Hand$q$, $q$This project presents the development of a low-cost, customizable 3D printed EMG-controlled prosthetic hand that utilizes surface electromyography signals to interpret user intent. By integrating affordable 3D printing materials, Arduino-based control electronics, servo actuation, and EMG signal processing, the system enables responsive and natural movement. …$q$, array[$q$Vinay G$q$,$q$Rayachoti Rajesh$q$,$q$Ningappa S$q$]::text[], 2025, $q$International Journal of Scientific Research in Engineering and Management$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.55041/ijsrem55602$q$, $q$10.55041/ijsrem55602$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1097/jpo.0000000000000097$q$, $q$An Open Source 3D-Printed Transitional Hand Prosthesis for Children$q$, $q$Advancements in computer-aided design programs, additive manufacturing, and open-source image editing software offer the possibility of designing, printing, and fitting transitional prosthetic hands at very low cost. The purpose of this study was to identify anthropometric, range of motion, and strength changes after 6 months of using a wrist-driven 3D-printed transitional prosthetic hand. …$q$, array[$q$Jorge M. Zuniga$q$,$q$Jean L. Peck$q$,$q$Rakesh Srivastava$q$]::text[], 2016, $q$JPO Journal of Prosthetics and Orthotics$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1097/jpo.0000000000000097$q$, $q$10.1097/jpo.0000000000000097$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.15866/ireme.v17i7.23455$q$, $q$Low-Cost Myoelectric Prosthetic Hand Design and Fabrication$q$, $q$Most myoelectric devices are very expensive, which makes them not available to everyone. This research aimed to create a low-cost motorized prosthetic hand using a 3D-printed material with five movable fingers, controlled by servo motors and evaluated with 10 different gripping patterns for daily activities. …$q$, array[$q$Yousif Ali Al-Dubaisi$q$,$q$Hussein M. H. Al-Khafaji$q$,$q$Ahmed Adnan Shandookh$q$]::text[], 2023, $q$International Review of Mechanical Engineering$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.15866/ireme.v17i7.23455$q$, $q$10.15866/ireme.v17i7.23455$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1089/soro.2016.0026$q$, $q$3D Printed Flexure Hinges for Soft Monolithic Prosthetic Fingers$q$, $q$This study investigates a number of commonly used flexure hinges to determine a morphology which generates large displacements under a lowest possible force input, to design a soft and monolithic robotic finger. Fused deposition modeling, a low-cost 3D printing technique, was used to fabricate the hinges and fingers. …$q$, array[$q$Rahim Mutlu$q$,$q$Gursel Alici$q$,$q$Marc in het Panhuis$q$]::text[], 2016, $q$Soft Robotics$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1089/soro.2016.0026$q$, $q$10.1089/soro.2016.0026$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1155/2022/9145352$q$, $q$Sensitivity Analysis of a Smart 3D-Printed Hand Prosthetic$q$, $q$Prosthesis performance was examined in the direction of prosthesis comfort, which may be incorporated into clinical practice for patient-specific prostheses. The prosthesis uses a brain-computer interface that receives EEG signals as input and drives actuators connected to cables to actuate the 3D-printed fingers and the wrist. …$q$, array[$q$Ebenezer Olubunmi Ige$q$,$q$Adedotun Adetunla$q$,$q$Adedamola Awesu$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$Journal of Robotics$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1155/2022/9145352$q$, $q$10.1155/2022/9145352$q$, array[$q$3D printing$q$,$q$prosthetic hand$q$,$q$low cost$q$,$q$upper limb$q$,$q$assistive technology$q$,$q$servo$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1109/tsmc.2016.2582745$q$, $q$Vehicle Routing Problems for Drone Delivery$q$, $q$Unmanned aerial vehicles, or drones, have the potential to significantly reduce the cost and time of making last-mile deliveries and responding to emergencies. We propose two multitrip vehicle routing problems for drone delivery that consider the effect of battery and payload weight on energy consumption. …$q$, array[$q$Kevin Dorling$q$,$q$Jordan Heinrichs$q$,$q$Geoffrey G. Messier$q$]::text[], 2016, $q$IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1109/tsmc.2016.2582745$q$, $q$10.1109/tsmc.2016.2582745$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1186/s12544-019-0368-2$q$, $q$Last mile delivery by drones: an estimation of viable market potential and access to citizens across European cities$q$, $q$Rapid technological developments in autonomous unmanned aerial vehicles and an evolving legislation may soon open the way for their large-scale implementation in the last mile delivery of products. The use of drones could drastically decrease labour costs and has been hyped as a potential disruptor to the parcel delivery industry. …$q$, array[$q$Jean-Philippe Aurambout$q$,$q$Konstantinos Gkoumas$q$,$q$Biagio Ciuffo$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$European Transport Research Review$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1186/s12544-019-0368-2$q$, $q$10.1186/s12544-019-0368-2$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1002/net.21818$q$, $q$Optimization approaches for civil applications of unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs) or aerial drones: A survey$q$, $q$Unmanned aerial vehicles are an emerging technology with significant market potential, for instance in monitoring infrastructure, spraying fields in precision agriculture, as well as in deliveries of packages. We provide a literature survey on optimization approaches to civil applications of UAVs. …$q$, array[$q$Alena Otto$q$,$q$Niels A.H. Agatz$q$,$q$James F. Campbell$q$]::text[], 2018, $q$Networks$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1002/net.21818$q$, $q$10.1002/net.21818$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1109/access.2021.3087751$q$, $q$Unmanned Aerial Vehicle Last-Mile Delivery Considering Backhauls$q$, $q$Utilizing unmanned aerial vehicles for delivery service has been drawing attention in the logistics industry. Since commercial UAVs have fundamental limitations on payloads and battery capacities, hybrid ground vehicle and UAV models have been investigated. We consider both linehaul and backhaul demands at the same time. …$q$, array[$q$Ahram Jeon$q$,$q$Joohang Kang$q$,$q$Byungil Choi$q$]::text[], 2021, $q$IEEE Access$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1109/access.2021.3087751$q$, $q$10.1109/access.2021.3087751$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3390/drones9060413$q$, $q$Unmanned Aerial Vehicles in Last-Mile Parcel Delivery: A State-of-the-Art Review$q$, $q$This review conducts an in-depth review of UAV research for last-mile delivery across seven domains: environmental performance, economic impacts, social impacts, policy and regulations, routing and scheduling, charging infrastructure, and energy consumption. …$q$, array[$q$Almodather Mohamed$q$,$q$Moataz Mohamed$q$]::text[], 2025, $q$Drones$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3390/drones9060413$q$, $q$10.3390/drones9060413$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3390/su142114473$q$, $q$Application of Unmanned Aerial Vehicles in Logistics: A Literature Review$q$, $q$Unmanned Aerial Vehicles are used in the logistics field because of their flexibility, low cost, environmental protection and energy-saving advantages. This paper reviews 36 studies on UAV applications in logistics from the Web of Science database from 2021 to 2022. …$q$, array[$q$Yi Li$q$,$q$Min Liu$q$,$q$Dandan Jiang$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$Sustainability$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3390/su142114473$q$, $q$10.3390/su142114473$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1002/cpe.6068$q$, $q$Solving the last mile problem in logistics: A mobile edge computing and blockchain-based unmanned aerial vehicle delivery system$q$, $q$The last mile problem in logistics is challenging due to its low efficiency and high cost. UAV delivery such as drone delivery has been proposed as a promising solution, but existing systems are based on cloud computing, which cannot meet real-time requirements, and raise security concerns. …$q$, array[$q$Xuejun Li$q$,$q$Lina Gong$q$,$q$Xiao Liu$q$]::text[], 2020, $q$Concurrency and Computation: Practice and Experience$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1002/cpe.6068$q$, $q$10.1002/cpe.6068$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1002/net.21847$q$, $q$Drone delivery from trucks: Drone scheduling for given truck routes$q$, $q$Last mile deliveries with drones are seen as one promising idea to reduce excessive road traffic. To overcome the short operating ranges of drones, trucks are used as mobile landing and take-off platforms. The paper schedules the delivery to customers by drones for given truck routes. …$q$, array[$q$Nils Boysen$q$,$q$Dirk Briskorn$q$,$q$Stefan Fedtke$q$]::text[], 2018, $q$Networks$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1002/net.21847$q$, $q$10.1002/net.21847$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1002/net.22015$q$, $q$Trucks and drones cooperation in the last-mile delivery process$q$, $q$We address the problem of routing a fleet of trucks equipped with drones to perform deliveries in the last-mile delivery process. The customers can be served by either a truck or a drone within their time windows. Each capacitated truck carries drones that can be launched to perform deliveries. …$q$, array[$q$Luigi Di Puglia Pugliese$q$,$q$Giusy Macrina$q$,$q$Francesca Guerriero$q$]::text[], 2020, $q$Networks$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1002/net.22015$q$, $q$10.1002/net.22015$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3390/drones9030158$q$, $q$A Review of Last-Mile Delivery Optimization: Strategies, Technologies, Drone Integration, and Future Trends$q$, $q$Last-mile delivery is an important aspect of contemporary logistics that directly affects operational cost, efficiency, and customer satisfaction. We review optimization techniques focusing on AI-driven decision-making, IoT-supported real-time monitoring, and hybrid delivery networks. …$q$, array[$q$Abdullahi Sani Shuaibu$q$,$q$Ashraf S. Hasan Mahmoud$q$,$q$Tarek Sheltami$q$]::text[], 2025, $q$Drones$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3390/drones9030158$q$, $q$10.3390/drones9030158$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3390/drones6060147$q$, $q$Towards the Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs): A Comprehensive Review$q$, $q$UAVs, also known as drones, have come in a great diversity of applications such as military, construction, mapping, medical, search and rescue, parcel delivery, precision farming, wireless communication and aerial surveillance. The drone industry is a model of manufacturing, service and delivery convergence. …$q$, array[$q$Syed Agha Hassnain Mohsan$q$,$q$Muhammad Asghar Khan$q$,$q$Fazal Noor$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$Drones$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3390/drones6060147$q$, $q$10.3390/drones6060147$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1016/j.cogr.2022.12.004$q$, $q$Unmanned aerial vehicles: A review$q$, $q$Lightweight UAV flight activities are constrained, particularly in range or endurance, by the communication link capabilities. This paper addresses the trade-off between mission requirements, UAV performance parameters and communication reliability. …$q$, array[$q$Asif Ali Laghari$q$,$q$Awais Khan Jumani$q$,$q$Rashid Ali Laghari$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$Cognitive Robotics$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cogr.2022.12.004$q$, $q$10.1016/j.cogr.2022.12.004$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Review$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1080/15568318.2024.2407150$q$, $q$Last mile delivery with drones: A carbon emissions comparison$q$, $q$This research presents a last mile delivery fleet model with drones that shows the optimal number of drones needed based on deterministic or stochastic demand using both traditional charging and battery swapping, and compares carbon emissions with conventional delivery vehicles. …$q$, array[$q$Jay R. Brown$q$,$q$Maxim A. Bushuev$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$International Journal of Sustainable Transportation$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1080/15568318.2024.2407150$q$, $q$10.1080/15568318.2024.2407150$q$, array[$q$drone$q$,$q$unmanned aerial vehicle$q$,$q$last-mile delivery$q$,$q$logistics$q$,$q$delivery$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, null, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.53378/352960$q$, $q$AQUAMAG: Smart Water Quality Monitoring through Internet of Things$q$, $q$This research aims to design and build a functional water monitoring system to guarantee a safe water supply. Using the AQUAMAG device and web-based platform, the water quality is assessed in real time, and the current water status is monitored. …$q$, array[$q$Nilo Tubio$q$,$q$Maria Sonia Alloso$q$,$q$Jenefer Mia Rabago$q$]::text[], 2023, $q$International Journal of Science, Technology, Engineering and Mathematics$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.53378/352960$q$, $q$10.53378/352960$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$water quality$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.55529/ijaap.22.23.29$q$, $q$Automated Plant Irrigation System and Monitoring System$q$, $q$The automated plant irrigation and monitoring system was created for farmers. This capstone project used an Arduino board. The features are based on identified needs of a farmland in Montevista, Davao de Oro, and measure temperature and soil conditions to control the amount and timing of water. …$q$, array[$q$Earl Joseph S. Villaruz$q$,$q$Joelyn P. Ladroma$q$,$q$Jahnna Mae R. Eyana$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$International Journal of Agriculture and Animal Production$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.55529/ijaap.22.23.29$q$, $q$10.55529/ijaap.22.23.29$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$capstone$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.33545/26633582.2019.v1.i2a.17$q$, $q$Automated relative humidity and temperature control system for banana tissue culture laboratory with monitoring system and SMS notification$q$, $q$The project automates relative humidity and temperature control and monitoring using SMS notification as part of an Internet of Things approach in a banana tissue culture laboratory. …$q$, array[$q$Dandy Uy Dalina$q$,$q$Noel Sobejana$q$]::text[], 2019, $q$International Journal of Engineering in Computer Science$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.33545/26633582.2019.v1.i2a.17$q$, $q$10.33545/26633582.2019.v1.i2a.17$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.47577/technium.v30i.12915$q$, $q$Property Office Management Digitalization for a Government-Owned and Controlled Corporation$q$, $q$The POMD is a web-based and mobile-responsive application developed to support the asset and property management functions of a government corporation. It enables real-time tracking of fixed assets with modules for asset registration, maintenance scheduling, depreciation tracking, and inventory reporting compliant with Commission on Audit requirements. …$q$, array[$q$Noli T. Tingson$q$,$q$Jake R. Pomperada$q$]::text[], 2025, $q$Technium Romanian Journal of Applied Sciences and Technology$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.47577/technium.v30i.12915$q$, $q$10.47577/technium.v30i.12915$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.61435/ijred.2024.60445$q$, $q$A framework to assess solar PV irrigation system (SPIS) for sustainable rice farming in Sorsogon, Philippines$q$, $q$Solar PV irrigation system has proven its potential to impact the agricultural sector. This study assessed the viability and sustainability of SPIS for providing rice irrigation in the province of Sorsogon, Philippines. …$q$, array[$q$Bryan E. Escoto$q$,$q$Michael Lochinvar S. Abundo$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$International Journal of Renewable Energy Development$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.61435/ijred.2024.60445$q$, $q$10.61435/ijred.2024.60445$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W7219332602$q$, $q$Centralized Automation of Steel Gates for Headgate Structure Using Solar at National Irrigation Administration, Guimba, Nueva Ecija, Philippines$q$, $q$The Philippines is an agricultural country where irrigation is essential. About 3.1 million hectares are considered irrigable and devoted primarily to rice and corn. The study develops centralized solar-powered automation of steel headgates for the National Irrigation Administration. …$q$, array[$q$Mary Jaycel Orlene P. Melegrito$q$,$q$Gary R. Gorospe$q$,$q$Rick Donald S. Manzon$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$International Journal of Progressive Research in Science and Engineering$q$, $q$https://openalex.org/W7219332602$q$, null, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.3390/su14116834$q$, $q$Socio-Economic and Environmental Analyses of Solar Irrigation Systems for Sustainable Agricultural Production$q$, $q$Solar irrigation is a climate mitigation technology to reduce greenhouse gas emissions in agricultural production. Small-scale farmers are unable to afford photovoltaic systems and resort to diesel-powered pumps. This study analyzes the social, economic, and environmental aspects of introducing solar irrigation from the perspective of small-scale farmers. …$q$, array[$q$Charmaine Samala Guno$q$,$q$Casper Boongaling Agaton$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$Sustainability$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.3390/su14116834$q$, $q$10.3390/su14116834$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1109/cencon58932.2023.10369714$q$, $q$Implementation of a Collapsible Solar Power Station for Farm Irrigation$q$, $q$A grid-isolated collapsible solar power station is developed for irrigation systems based on the actual water requirements of the crops and the farm. The contribution lies in elaborating the methodology for designing a solar-powered irrigation system based on the target area's water requirement. …$q$, array[$q$Anton Louise P. De Ocampo$q$,$q$Mark Justine M. Domingo$q$,$q$John Miko Malinao$q$]::text[], 2023, $q$IEEE Conference on Energy Conversion$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1109/cencon58932.2023.10369714$q$, $q$10.1109/cencon58932.2023.10369714$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$water quality$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$W7219233639$q$, $q$Performance Assessment of Solar-Powered Irrigation Project in Nueva Ecija$q$, $q$Nueva Ecija has been the largest rice-producing province in the country for decades. The study assesses the performance of a solar-powered irrigation project supporting sustainable economic development of rice farming communities. …$q$, array[$q$Jomar R. Merciales$q$,$q$Irene P. Estacio$q$,$q$Carlos S. Ladores Jr.$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$International Journal of Progressive Research in Science and Engineering$q$, $q$https://openalex.org/W7219233639$q$, null, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$]::text[], $q$Case study$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.21622/resd.2024.10.1.829$q$, $q$Renewable energy in sustainable agricultural production: real options approach to solar irrigation investment under uncertainty$q$, $q$Solar-powered irrigation system is a sustainable technology that utilizes renewable energy to pump water. This study evaluates the attractiveness of shifting to SPIS from diesel-powered irrigation using the case of small-scale farmers in the Philippines. …$q$, array[$q$Casper Boongaling Agaton$q$,$q$Charmaine Samala Guno$q$]::text[], 2024, $q$Renewable Energy and Sustainable Development$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.21622/resd.2024.10.1.829$q$, $q$10.21622/resd.2024.10.1.829$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$,$q$water quality$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1109/smartgencon56628.2022.10084132$q$, $q$Design of Solar-powered Irrigation System based on Penman-Monteith Model$q$, $q$Farming faces difficulties brought by climate change, and one of the most pressing problems is how to use available resources in a more cost-friendly way such as renewable energy. A solar-powered irrigation system is designed based on the Penman-Monteith evapotranspiration model. …$q$, array[$q$Ferdinand Delos Reyes$q$,$q$Anton Louise P. De Ocampo$q$,$q$Melmar D. Eje$q$]::text[], 2022, $q$International Conference on Smart Generation Computing, Communication and Networking$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1109/smartgencon56628.2022.10084132$q$, $q$10.1109/smartgencon56628.2022.10084132$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
