  ($q$paper$q$, $q$OpenAlex$q$, $q$10.1109/hnicem54116.2021.9731960$q$, $q$Hybrid Solar-Hydrokinetic Powered Automated Irrigation System$q$, $q$This paper proposes a design of an automated irrigation system powered by solar and hydrokinetic energy. The simulation was scaled down to a 10 sqm garden, simulating rice fields, testing varying irrigation points to find the most conservative amount of water distributed. …$q$, array[$q$Paul Andre F. Tapiceria$q$,$q$Glenn V. Magwili$q$]::text[], 2021, $q$IEEE International Conference on Humanoid, Nanotechnology, Information Technology, Communication and Control, Environment, and Management$q$, $q$https://doi.org/10.1109/hnicem54116.2021.9731960$q$, $q$10.1109/hnicem54116.2021.9731960$q$, array[$q$Philippines$q$,$q$solar$q$,$q$irrigation$q$]::text[], $q$Journal article$q$, null, $q$Philippines$q$, $q$OpenAlex API$q$, timestamptz '2026-10-29 00:00:00+00', false),
